## Frontend structure

- Require `{{frontend.root}}`, `{{frontend.appsRoot}}`, and
  `{{frontend.libsRoot}}` to be normalized target-relative paths without
  absolute roots, traversal, or unresolved values.
- Require the application and library roots to be distinct strict descendants
  of the frontend root and reject duplicate or frontend/backend collisions.
- Require `{{frontend.scopeName}}` to be one safe path segment.
- Keep maintained applications, reusable libraries, generated artifacts, and
  platform adapters in explicit non-overlapping boundaries.
- A workspace provider is optional; the resolved frontend paths remain valid
  when selected independently.
